LOGIN 
-----
 When signing up, the user fills in all required details and clicks the Signup button. The request is first sent to Firebase, 
 which creates a new user account. Once the Firebase user is created, the user details are also stored in our database. 
 A verification link is then sent to the email provided by the user. When the user clicks on the link, 
 it redirects to our application, where the frontend extracts the oob code and validates it with Firebase. 
 If the verification is successful, the user can then log in properly.